If item rewards are eventually switched back on, the same Bubble should grant the +5 ultimate charge and then continue through the normal item roll exactly once.

Because this goes through ultDelta(), collecting a Bubble during an already-active ultimate must not extend that active ultimate’s 15-second duration.

Apply the reward equally to player, bot, and local-human collectors.

10. Rebalance normal boost duration and refill

The normal boost already provides the desired 1.5× multiplier. Preserve that value.

A full normal boost bar must now last 5.5 seconds instead of ~2.5 seconds.

A completely empty normal boost bar must now refill in 5.0 seconds instead of ~7 seconds.

Do not approximate these by eye.

The mathematically correct normalized rates are:

drain = 1 / 5.5; // ≈ 0.1818181818 per second
refill = 1 / 5;  // 0.2 per second

Do not continue scattering those rates as duplicated magic numbers.

Create shared tuning constants in js/data.js, for example:

const BOOST_SPEED = 1.5;
const BOOST_DRAIN_TIME = 5.5;
const BOOST_REFILL_TIME = 5.0;
const BOOST_DRAIN_RATE = 1 / BOOST_DRAIN_TIME;
const BOOST_REFILL_RATE = 1 / BOOST_REFILL_TIME;

Then replace all relevant player and rival/local-human paths in js/race.js.

The player’s existing:

G.charge = clamp(G.charge - dt * 0.4, 0, 1);
G.charge = clamp(G.charge + dt * 0.14, 0, 1);

must use the new shared rates.

All corresponding rival paths using R.charge must use those exact same rates.

The existing ×1.5 applications for player and rivals should use the shared BOOST_SPEED constant so the value cannot drift between implementations.

Preserve the existing dry-bar lockout behavior: reaching zero locks boost, and boost becomes available again only after the bar returns to full.

Do not alter bot decision-making simply to force them to burn the full 5.5 seconds. Their intelligence may still release boost early according to D.keep, hazards, or race strategy. The capacity of the boost system is what changes.

Do not confuse normal boost with other speed effects.

Leave the Mystery Bubble boost can alone:

CAN_TIME = 2.2
CAN_SPEED = 1.55

Leave the rear-end shunt alone:

SHUNT_TIME = 0.8
SHUNT_BOOST = 1.35

Leave the shared ultimate speed multiplier at 2.0.

